  "title": "Isolated Island",
  "storyCode": "1-1",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_01-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "50c23a29cb4f979f8f6c80f602f8d7c7f4ac051e1dc9277b24a32a22ec341951",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第七关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "text": "Is it just me, or is the sky getting darker?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "...If only it was just you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "We never had much time anyway.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "The shape of the Catastrophe cloud is more clearly defined than the black haze it was before.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Tsk. I don't like the feeling I get from watching it form over our heads. What a bad omen.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "To make things worse, Reunion goons might be lurking in every nook and cranny.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Actually, that's probably too conservative.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "What you should've said is that they're probably partying on the streets.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Almost every street is filled with destruction, violence and looting. Vehicles and buildings are being set on fire...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "But these thugs decide that it's the perfect weather for a picnic!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "If they're going out on a picnic now, it's the Catastrophe that will feast upon their bones.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "This proves that most Reunion members are just fools who've been whipped into a frenzy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "...Pfft.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Look, they're not really having a picnic...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "I, I just wanted something to moan about. You didn't have to take me so seriously...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Oh, you weren't being serious？Wait, were you trying to crack a joke?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Hmm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Sorry, I'm not good with this stuff...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Umm... It's fine...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "It's just that... trying not to laugh is hard...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "Um, sorry... for trying to make a joke at such a serious time...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "It's okay.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Rhodes Island wasn't founded for the sake of having everyone keep a serious face.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We've always wanted everyone to be able to smile.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "text": "A-Amiya...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Don't worry about it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "In any case, let's help out with the scouting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "I'll quietly dispatch the enemy at our four o'clock.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Hopefully their diseased organs won't explode or be rigged to serve as some kind of alarm.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "We'll wrap around and take care of the large group on the other side of the fortification.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "With this much chaos around us, nobody will notice a little more noise.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "All right, let's move out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
